+
+Added `workspace/corner_box_lesson_probe.py`, a source-pinned protected-Racket
+replay for default seed 9.  All three consecutive demonstrations place the
+marker box in a canvas corner, so the executable shortcut “apply the canonical
+rule only for corner boxes; otherwise return the input” fits every demonstration.
+The next generated query uses an interior marker box and differs from canonical
+by 10 cells.  The production generator and accepted parametric family remain
+unchanged.  A lesson-level repair is to include a visible interior-box example
+or add this canvas-position-conditioned rival to admission.
