+## 2026-10-25 optional lesson probe: nearest-template shortcut
+
+Added `workspace/nearest_template_lesson_probe.py`, a source-pinned
+protected-Racket replay for default seed 163.  The executable shortcut ignores
+shape identity and recolors each query with the nearest template's color by
+size-scaled centroid Manhattan distance.  It fits all three consecutive
+demonstrations but changes the four-template query by 17 cells.  The production
+generator remains unchanged.  A lesson-level repair is to include a visible
+case where nearest position conflicts with exact shape identity, or add this
+rival to admission.
+
+The staged task suite also exposed an inherited test-only portability defect:
+the test located canonical data with a fixed parent depth and then required
+byte-identical formatting across semantically identical Racket authorities.
+The test now uses `reviewer_support.find_root` / `canonical_path` and compares
+normalized authority text; the copied-runtime suite passes 12/12.
